alibrated statistical features (sentence-length CV Cohen's d=1.22, short-sentence fraction d=1.21, comma density, GLTR rank buckets, DivEye surprisal). Unified CLI: ./humanize {detect,rewrite,academic,style,compare}. 7 style transforms (casual/zhihu/xiaohongshu/wechat/academic/literary/weibo), 40 paraphrase templates, 122 academic replacements, CiLin synonym expansion with semantic filter. Academic paper AIGC reduction for CNKI/VIP/Wanfang (知网/维普/万方 AIGC 检测降重), 11 academic detection dimensions. Pure Python, no dependencies. v3.0.0 — HC3 accuracy 73%, humanize avg delta +4.2 on HC3-Chinese 100-sample. Use when user says: \"去AI味\", \"降AIGC\", \"人性化文本\", \"humanize chinese\", \"AI检测\", \"AIGC降重\", \"去除AI痕迹\", \"文本改写\", \"论文降重\", \"知网检测\", \"维普检测\", \"AI写作检测\", \"让文字更自然\", \"detect AI text\", \"humanize text\", \"reduce AIGC score\", \"make text human-like\", \"去ai化\", \"改成人话\", \"去机器味\", \"降低AI率\", \"过AIGC检测\" allowed-tools:\n[...]\n# Humanize Chinese AI Text v3.0\n[...]\n检测和改写中文 AI 生成文本的完整工具链。可独立运行（统一 CLI 或独立脚本），也可作为 LLM prompt 指南使用。\n[...]\n在`scripts/`目录下，纯 Python，无依赖。\n[...]\n```\n#\n[...]\n规则维度\n[...]\n8 统计特征，\n[...]\n-100 分）\npython scripts/detect\n[...]\n.py text.txt\npython scripts/detect_cn.py text.txt -v          # 详细 + 最可疑句子\npython scripts/detect_cn.py text.txt -s           # 仅评分\npython scripts/detect_cn.py text.txt -j           # JSON 输出\n[...]\n# 改写（三档自适应：conservative/moderate/full\n[...]\npython scripts/human\n[...]\n.py text.txt -o clean.txt\n[...]\npython scripts/human\n[...]\n.py text.txt --scene social -a   #\n[...]\npython scripts/human\n[...]\ntext.txt --quick             #\n[...]\n18× 速度，纯替换\n[...]\ncilin\n[...]\nCiLin 同义词扩展\n\n---\n\nTitle: Humanize Chinese | Claude Code Skills\nURL: https://claudemarketplaces.com/skills/voidborne-d/humanize-chinese/humanize-chinese\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\nHumanize Chinese | Claude Code Skills\n\nHumanize Chinese | Claude Code Skills\nCLAUDE CODE MARKETPLACES\n# Humanize Chinese\nEditor's Note\nThis is a detection and rewriting toolkit for Chinese AI-generated text that's hit version 5.0 with some serious refinements. The headline feature is scene-aware classification using three fused language recognition models (general, academic, longform) that hit 95% accuracy on the HC3 dataset. It includes a best-of-n sampling mode that runs multiple humanization passes and picks the least detectable output, plus paragraph-level signals like length variation and cross-paragraph trigram analysis to catch repetitive patterns. You can run it as standalone CLI tools or use it as prompt engineering guidance. The novel/longform scene modes and anti-detection rewriting are clearly aimed at longer content where AI tells tend to compound. Over 300 installs and active development.\n## Install\n```\nnpx skills add https://github.com/voidborne-d/humanize-chinese --skill humanize-chinese\n```\nSKILL.md\nVotes\n0\nInstalls302\nGitHub Stars362\nFirst SeenJun 3, 2026\nView on GitHub\nComments\nLogin to comment"}
