{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_1cyxzS1y39j7ZhS7oCMe4176","name":"run_command","content":"$ python -c \"\nimport re, docx\nfrom docx.shared import Pt, Cm\n\npath = r'C:\\Users\\27063\\Desktop\\工具箱\\论文降低aigc分析文献库\\v5_纯净替换版.txt'\nwith open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    t = f.read()\n\ndoc = docx.Document()\nfor section in doc.sections:\n    section.top_margin = Cm(2.54); section.bottom_margin = Cm(2.54)\n    section.left_margin = Cm(3.17); section.right_margin = Cm(3.17)\nfor para_text in [l.strip() for l in t.strip().split('\\n') if l.strip()]:\n    p = doc.add_paragraph()\n    p.add_run(para_text).font.size = Pt(12)\n    p.paragraph_format.first_line_indent = Cm(0.74)\n    p.paragraph_format.line_spacing = 1.5\n\nout = r'C:\\Users\\27063\\Desktop\\工具箱\\论文降低aigc分析文献库\\v5_纯净替换版.docx'\ndoc.save(out)\nprint(f'v5: {out}')\n\"\n[exit 0]\nv5: C:\\Users\\27063\\Desktop\\工具箱\\论文降低aigc分析文献库\\v5_纯净替换版.docx\r\n"}
