{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_kw0hvomvFIgd5LoAYMVH9294","type":"function","function":{"name":"run_command","arguments":"{\"command\": \"python -c \\\"\\nimport re\\npath = r'C:\\\\Users\\\\27063\\\\Desktop\\\\工具箱\\\\论文降低aigc分析文献库\\\\v6_风格断裂版.txt'\\nwith open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    t = f.read()\\nt += '国际制度的设计和完善需要考虑到一个基本事实：各国的利益和偏好存在结构性差异，短期内不可能消除。认识到差异的存在不是放弃合作的借口，反而是寻找务实合作路径的前提。在差异最大的安全领域保持危机管控的底线，在差异较小的发展领域扩大合作的范围，在差异中等的环境和公共卫生领域探索建立更加有效的协调机制——这条从技术到政治、从低敏感度到高敏感度的渐进路径已经在国际关系的实践中被多次证明是可行的。继续沿着这个方向推进，虽然不会有立竿见影的突破，但长期积累的效应应该不会令人失望。'\\nwith open(path,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    f.write(t)\\ncn = len(re.findall(r'[\\\\u4e00-\\\\u9fff]', t))\\nif cn >= 10000:\\n    import docx\\n    from docx.shared import Pt, Cm\\n    doc = docx.Document()\\n    for section in doc.sections:\\n        section.top_margin = Cm(2.54); section.bottom_margin = Cm(2.54)\\n        section.left_margin = Cm(3.17); section.right_margin = Cm(3.17)\\n    for para in [l.strip() for l in t.strip().split('\\\\n') if l.strip()]:\\n        p = doc.add_paragraph()\\n        p.add_run(para).font.size = Pt(12)\\n        p.paragraph_format.first_line_indent = Cm(0.74)\\n        p.paragraph_format.line_spacing = 1.5\\n    out = r'C:\\\\Users\\\\27063\\\\Desktop\\\\工具箱\\\\论文降低aigc分析文献库\\\\v6_风格断裂版.docx'\\n    doc.save(out)\\n    print(f'字数:{cn} ✅ 已保存')\\nelse:\\n    print(f'字数:{cn}')\\n\\\"\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"488 more chars. Let me add quickly to reach 10000."}
