{"role":"assistant","content":"明白了。黑色=<50%就算通过。让我重新分析检测报告：","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_68YcfilQ0cpNS1HmnpIW9492","type":"function","function":{"name":"run_command","arguments":"{\"command\": \"python -c \\\"\\nimport docx\\nfrom collections import Counter\\n\\npath = r'C:\\\\Users\\\\27063\\\\Desktop\\\\工具箱\\\\论文降低aigc分析文献库\\\\免费_Word标红版_AIGC检测报告_[标题未输入].docx'\\ndoc = docx.Document(path)\\n\\n# 红色>70% | 橙色60-70% | 紫色50-60% | 黑色<50% | 灰色不检测\\ncolor_stats = {'red':0,'orange':0,'purple':0,'black':0,'gray':0,'unknown':0}\\ntotal_chars = 0\\n\\nfor p in doc.paragraphs:\\n    if not p.text.strip(): continue\\n    for run in p.runs:\\n        if not run.text.strip(): continue\\n        total_chars += len(run.text.strip())\\n        if run.font.color and run.font.color.rgb:\\n            r, g, b = run.font.color.rgb[0], run.font.color.rgb[1], run.font.color.rgb[2]\\n            if r > 150 and g < 100 and b < 100:\\n                color_stats['red'] += len(run.text.strip())\\n            elif r > 150 and g > 100 and b < 80:\\n                color_stats['orange'] += len(run.text.strip())\\n            elif r > 100 and g < 100 and b > 100:\\n                color_stats['purple'] += len(run.text.strip())\\n            elif r < 50 and g < 50 and b < 50:\\n                color_stats['black'] += len(run.text.strip())\\n            else:\\n                color_stats['unknown'] += len(run.text.strip())\\n        else:\\n            color_stats['gray'] += len(run.text.strip())\\n\\nprint(f'总字符: {total_chars}')\\nprint()\\nfor color, chars in sorted(color_stats.items(), key=lambda x:-x[1]):\\n    pct = chars/total_chars*100 if total_chars else 0\\n    label = {'red':'🔴 红色>70%','orange':'🟠 橙色60-70%','purple':'🟣 紫色50-60%','black':'⚫ 黑色<50%通过','gray':'⬜ 灰色不检测','unknown':'❓ 未知'}[color]\\n    print(f'{label}: {chars}字 ({pct:.1f}%)')\\n\\\"\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"The user is telling me the actual meaning of the colors in the detection report:\n- Red: 70%+ AI probability (highly suspected)\n- Orange: 60-70% AI probability (moderately suspected)\n- Purple: 50-60% AI probability (mildly suspected)\n- Black: Below 50% AI probability (pass)\n- Gray: Not detected (titles, English, etc.)\n\nThis is important information. My previous analysis was treating all red as \"100% AI\" but actually red means 70%+ probability. Black means passing (<50%).\n\nLet me re-analyze the latest report with this new understanding. The v11 version that I just created needs to be tested. But let me first check the current report to see what's still being flagged.\n\nActually, the user is probably telling me this because they want me to understand the color coding so I can better target my efforts. The key insight: black = pass (<50%), I should aim to get everything to black.\n\nLet me check the current detection report."}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_68YcfilQ0cpNS1HmnpIW9492","name":"run_command","content":"$ python -c \"\nimport docx\nfrom collections import Counter\n\npath = r'C:\\Users\\27063\\Desktop\\工具箱\\论文降低aigc分析文献库\\免费_Word标红版_AIGC检测报告_[标题未输入].docx'\ndoc = docx.Document(path)\n\n# 红色>70% | 橙色60-70% | 紫色50-60% | 黑色<50% | 灰色不检测\ncolor_stats = {'red':0,'orange':0,'purple':0,'black':0,'gray':0,'unknown':0}\ntotal_chars = 0\n\nfor p in doc.paragraphs:\n    if not p.text.strip(): continue\n    for run in p.runs:\n        if not run.text.strip(): continue\n        total_chars += len(run.text.strip())\n        if run.font.color and run.font.color.rgb:\n            r, g, b = run.font.color.rgb[0], run.font.color.rgb[1], run.font.color.rgb[2]\n            if r > 150 and g < 100 and b < 100:\n                color_stats['red'] += len(run.text.strip())\n            elif r > 150 and g > 100 and b < 80:\n                color_stats['orange'] += len(run.text.strip())\n            elif r > 100 and g < 100 and b > 100:\n                color_stats['purple'] += len(run.text.strip())\n            elif r < 50 and g < 50 and b < 50:\n                color_stats['black'] += len(run.text.strip())\n            else:\n                color_stats['unknown'] += len(run.text.strip())\n        else:\n            color_stats['gray'] += len(run.text.strip())\n\nprint(f'总字符: {total_chars}')\nprint()\nfor color, chars in sorted(color_stats.items(), key=lambda x:-x[1]):\n    pct = chars/total_chars*100 if total_chars else 0\n    label = {'red':'🔴 红色>70%','orange':'🟠 橙色60-70%','purple':'🟣 紫色50-60%','black':'⚫ 黑色<50%通过','gray':'⬜ 灰色不检测','unknown':'❓ 未知'}[color]\n    print(f'{label}: {chars}字 ({pct:.1f}%)')\n\"\n[exit 0]\n总字符: 10797\r\n\r\n🔴 红色>70%: 9106字 (84.3%)\r\n⚫ 黑色<50%通过: 887字 (8.2%)\r\n🟠 橙色60-70%: 409字 (3.8%)\r\n❓ 未知: 395字 (3.7%)\r\n🟣 紫色50-60%: 0字 (0.0%)\r\n⬜ 灰色不检测: 0字 (0.0%)\r\n"}
