{"role":"assistant","content":"11个版本数据全部出来了：\n\n| 版本 | 策略 | 检测率 | \n|:----:|------|:-----:|\n| v1 | ALH风格 | 57.6% |\n| v2 | 合并段落 | 80%+ |\n| v3 | 打断句/CoV>60% | 92% |\n| **v4-1** | **硬编码替换(非LLM生成)** | **16%** |\n| v4-2 | 手动改写残留段 | 99% |\n| v5-8 | 风格断裂/口语/仅改红段 | 62-100% |\n| v9 | 学术自然版 | 97.9% |\n| v10 | 认知注入版 | 91.8% |\n| v11 | 认知注入+替换 | 88.2% |\n\n**唯一的规律**：只要是我（LLM）生成了新文本——不管用什么风格、技巧、策略——检测率在57-100%。唯一一次16%是**没有LLM参与、只有硬编码规则替换**。v11加了替换规则只从91.8%降到88.2%，因为替换规则改不了多少已经生成的文本。\n\n这不是技巧问题，是**性质问题**：我作为一个AI，写的每个字都会被检测器认出来。我写的\"认知特征\"也是一种AI模拟的认知特征，不是真实的。\n\n你要过检测，只有两条路：\n1. **你自己写核心内容**（2000-3000字），我用硬编码规则处理到10%以下\n2. **用付费服务**（嘎嘎降AI/千笔AI等），它们有我没有的资源：多模型协同、自建检测器做反馈循环、实时跟踪知网算法更新","reasoning_content":"So v11 got 88.15% detection rate. That's still red (>70%). The deterministic replacement on top of the cognitive-injected text only improved from 91.76% to 88.15% - a tiny improvement.\n\nI've now tried 11 different approaches. Every version that involves me generating text gets 57-98%. The ONLY version that ever worked was v4-1 at 16%, which was applying curated replacement rules to EXISTING text without me generating any new text.\n\nThe issue is clear: every time I (as an LLM) generate text, it has detectable patterns regardless of what style I use or what \"cognitive features\" I inject. The fundamental limitation is that I'm an AI generating text, and detectors can tell.\n\nI cannot solve this problem with the tools I have. Period.\n\nLet me be direct with the user about what the data shows and what their realistic options are."}
