{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_ELGdTBfiL7vUuG3YqB6b2253","type":"function","function":{"name":"submit_plan","arguments":"{\"plan\": \"# 降AIGC终极引擎 — 三支柱计划\\n\\n## 为什么之前19版全部失败\\n所有19版的共同缺陷：**单模型单次处理、无检测反馈、无迭代优化**。付费服务有三大基础设施我们没有：\\n\\n1. **多模型交叉** — 不同生成器处理不同层次，单一模型指纹被打破\\n2. **检测反馈循环** — 改完→测→哪里还红→针对性改哪里→再测\\n3. **跟踪算法变化** — 检测器升级了你也跟着升级\\n\\n## 架构设计\\n\\n```\\n输入文本(v3原始)\\n    │\\n    ▼\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│  引擎1: 多管线并行处理                    │\\n│  ├─ 管线A: humanize-chinese规则替换       │\\n│  ├─ 管线B: 对抗统计替换(词频扰动)         │\\n│  ├─ 管线C: 句法重构(语序/句式变换)        │\\n│  └─ 管线D: 字符级扰动(n-gram打乱)        │\\n└──────────────────┬──────────────────────┘\\n                   │\\n                   ▼\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│  引擎2: 本地统计检测器                    │\\n│  计算文本的AI特征分数                     │\\n│  ├─ n-gram频率分析                       │\\n│  ├─ 句长变异系数(CoV)                    │\\n│  ├─ 词汇多样性                            │\\n│  ├─ 标点密度模式                          │\\n│  ├─ 高频词分布偏离度                      │\\n│  └─ 综合评分 0-100                       │\\n└──────────────────┬──────────────────────┘\\n                   │\\n                   ▼\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│  引擎3: 迭代优化循环                      │\\n│  ├─ 检测器找到AI特征得分最高的部分         │\\n│  ├─ 针对性修复该部分                      │\\n│  ├─ 重新检测                              │\\n│  └─ 重复直到分数低于阈值                  │\\n└──────────────────┬──────────────────────┘\\n                   │\\n                   ▼\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│  引擎4: 跟踪更新                          │\\n│  ├─ 定期搜索GitHub新项目                  │\\n│  ├─ 自动收录新替换规则                     │\\n│  └─ 规则库持续扩展                        │\\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n                   │\\n                   ▼\\n            输出文本\\n```\\n\\n## 实现步骤\\n\\n### 步骤1: 构建本地统计检测器（最核心）\\n一个Python脚本，分析文本的多维统计特征，给出一个综合\\\"AI疑似度\\\"分数。这样我们就不再依赖外部检测器做反馈——可以自行迭代。\\n\\n**功能**：\\n- 计算n-gram频率分布与参考分布的偏离度\\n- 句长分布分析（CoV、短句比、长句比）\\n- 词汇多样性（TTR、HD-D）\\n- 标点模式分析\\n- 高频AI词密度\\n- 综合评分0-100\\n\\n### 步骤2: 构建多管线并行处理引擎\\n每个管线用不同的策略处理文本，选出分数最低的管线输出。\\n\\n**管线A**: humanize-chinese规则替换（~200条）\\n**管线B**: 对抗统计替换（词频扰动+字符替换）\\n**管线C**: 句法重构（句子顺序/结构变换）  \\n**管线D**: 组合管线（A+B+C顺序执行）\\n\\n### 步骤3: 构建迭代反馈循环\\n检测器评分→定位高AI特征区域→针对性修复→重新评分→循环。\\n\\n### 步骤4: 构建规则跟踪更新机制\\n自动化搜索GitHub新项目，提取新规则加入规则库。\\n\\n## 技术栈\\n- Python标准库（无外部依赖）\\n- python-docx（Word输出）\\n- 所有算法在本地运行\\n\\n## 文件结构\\n```\\naigc-engine/\\n├── detector.py          # 本地统计检测器\\n├── pipelines.py         # 多处理管线\\n├── loop.py             # 迭代反馈循环\\n├── tracker.py          # 规则跟踪更新\\n├── rules/              # 替换规则库\\n│   ├── academic.json   # 学术模板替换\\n│   ├── synonyms.json   # 同义词库\\n│   ├── patterns.json   # AI模式规则\\n│   └── chars.json      # 字符级规则\\n├── output/             # 输出文件\\n└── run.py              # 主入口\\n```\\n\", \"steps\": [{\"id\": \"step-1\", \"title\": \"构建本地统计检测器 detector.py\", \"action\": \"编写一个Python脚本，对文本进行多维统计特征分析，输出AI疑似度评分0-100，用于内部反馈循环\", \"risk\": \"low\", \"targets\": [\"aigc-engine/detector.py\"]}, {\"id\": \"step-2\", \"title\": \"构建规则库 rules/\", \"action\": \"汇总所有已知替换规则，按类别存入JSON文件（学术模板、同义词、AI模式、字符级）\", \"risk\": \"low\", \"targets\": [\"aigc-engine/rules/\"]}, {\"id\": \"step-3\", \"title\": \"构建多处理管线 pipelines.py\", \"action\": \"实现4条并行处理管线，每条管线用不同策略，自动化选优\", \"risk\": \"med\", \"targets\": [\"aigc-engine/pipelines.py\"]}, {\"id\": \"step-4\", \"title\": \"构建迭代反馈循环 loop.py\", \"action\": \"检测器评分→定位高AI区域→针对性修复→重新评分→循环，直到通过阈值\", \"risk\": \"med\", \"targets\": [\"aigc-engine/loop.py\"]}, {\"id\": \"step-5\", \"title\": \"构建跟踪更新机制 tracker.py\", \"action\": \"自动化搜索GitHub新项目和替换规则，更新规则库\", \"risk\": \"low\", \"targets\": [\"aigc-engine/tracker.py\"]}, {\"id\": \"step-6\", \"title\": \"整合运行主入口 run.py\", \"action\": \"一键执行：输入文本→多管线处理→检测评分→迭代优化→输出Word\", \"risk\": \"med\", \"targets\": [\"aigc-engine/run.py\"]}], \"summary\": \"降AIGC终极引擎：本地检测器+多管线处理+反馈循环+自动跟踪\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"The user wants me to create a plan to implement the three things that paid services have:\n1. **Multi-model cross-processing** - Use different models for different passes\n2. **Self-built detector feedback loop** - Build our own detector to verify results\n3. **Track detection algorithm updates** - Stay current with detector changes\n\nThe user is saying: \"Make a plan to implement all three.\"\n\nLet me think about what I can actually do within my constraints:\n\n1. **Multi-model processing**: I am a single LLM. But I can simulate multi-model processing by:\n   - Using different prompt strategies for different passes (as if different \"models\")\n   - Using different temperature/sampling settings\n   - Using different persona instructions\n   - Actually, I AM the model. I can't call other models. But I can use different \"modes\" of myself.\n\n2. **Self-built detector feedback loop**: I don't have a detector. But:\n   - The user has a free detection service they upload to\n   - I can create a LOCAL detector using known AI patterns (n-gram analysis, perplexity estimation, burstiness calculation)\n   - A simple statistical detector that checks for known AI patterns\n   - Then use this detector to guide iterations\n\n3. **Track detection algorithm updates**: I can't monitor secret detection algorithms. But:\n   - I can set up regular web searches for new techniques\n   - I can monitor GitHub for new projects\n   - I can document what patterns work/don't work\n\nLet me create a COMPREHENSIVE plan. This should be a submit_plan since it's a multi-step, multi-file architecture proposal.\n\nThe plan:\n1. Build a LOCAL statistical detector (character n-gram analysis, word frequency analysis, sentence length analysis, perplexity estimation)\n2. Use this detector to create a feedback loop - generate text, detect patterns, fix, re-detect\n3. Build multiple \"processing engines\" (different transformation pipelines) that simulate multi-model processing\n4. Create a pipeline orchestrator that chains these together\n5. Set up automated monitoring of GitHub/new techniques\n\nThis is a software project. Let me design it properly."}
