{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_M09ttAIXop9vg7j1ctvh0653","type":"function","function":{"name":"run_command","arguments":"{\"command\": \"python -c \\\"\\nimport pdfplumber, re\\npath = r'C:\\\\Users\\\\27063\\\\Desktop\\\\工具箱\\\\论文降低aigc分析文献库\\\\免费_PDF打印版_AIGC检测报告_[论文（修改)].pdf'\\nwith pdfplumber.open(path) as pdf:\\n    full_text = ''\\n    for page in pdf.pages:\\n        t = page.extract_text()\\n        if t: full_text += t + '\\\\n'\\n\\ncn = len(re.findall(r'[\\\\u4e00-\\\\u9fff]', full_text))\\nprint(f'总字数(含检测信息): {cn}')\\nprint('='*60)\\n\\n# 提取正文部分（跳过检测头部信息）\\nlines = full_text.split('\\\\n')\\nbody_start = 0\\nfor i, line in enumerate(lines):\\n    if '课程论文' in line:\\n        body_start = i\\n        break\\n\\nbody = '\\\\n'.join(lines[body_start:])\\ncn_body = len(re.findall(r'[\\\\u4e00-\\\\u9fff]', body))\\nprint(f'正文字数: {cn_body}')\\n\\nprint('='*60)\\nprint('=== 写作特征分析 ===')\\nprint('='*60)\\n\\n# 特征1: 第一人称\\nwo = body.count('我') + body.count('我们')\\nprint(f'1. 第一人称我/我们: {wo}次')\\n\\n# 特征2: 模糊限定词\\nfuzzy = ['差不多','比较','不太','很难','越来越','较为','相对来说','基本上']\\nfor f in fuzzy:\\n    c = body.count(f)\\n    if c > 0: print(f'2. 模糊词\\\\\\\"{f}\\\\\\\": {c}次')\\n\\n# 特征3: 学生标记词\\nstu = ['也就是说','换句话说','说白了','我觉得','我认为','从我的角度来看']\\nfor s in stu:\\n    c = body.count(s)\\n    if c > 0: print(f'3. 学生标记\\\\\\\"{s}\\\\\\\": {c}次')\\n\\n# 特征4: 具体内容标记\\nspec = ['模型','数据','回归','实证','检验','案例','公式','变量','假设']\\nfor s in spec:\\n    c = body.count(s)\\n    if c > 0: print(f'4. 具体内容\\\\\\\"{s}\\\\\\\": {c}次')\\n\\n# 特征5: AI套话残留\\nai_ph = ['综上所述','总而言之','值得注意的是','不可否认','毋庸置疑']\\nfor p in ai_ph:\\n    c = body.count(p)\\n    if c > 0: print(f'5. AI套话\\\\\\\"{p}\\\\\\\": {c}次')\\n\\n# 特征6: 破折号\\ndash = body.count('——')\\nprint(f'6. 破折号: {dash}个')\\n\\n# 特征7: 句长分布\\nimport math\\nsents = []\\nfor p in body.split('\\\\n'):\\n    for s in re.split(r'[。！？；]', p):\\n        c = len(re.findall(r'[\\\\u4e00-\\\\u9fff]', s.strip()))\\n        if c >= 4: sents.append(c)\\nif sents:\\n    avg = sum(sents)/len(sents)\\n    std = math.sqrt(sum((s-avg)**2 for s in sents)/len(sents))\\n    cov = std/avg*100\\n    short = sum(1 for s in sents if s<15)/len(sents)*100\\n    long = sum(1 for s in sents if s>40)/len(sents)*100\\n    print(f'8. 句长: 均值{avg:.1f} CoV:{cov:.1f}% 短句{short:.1f}% 长句{long:.1f}%')\\n\\\"\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"The .wps file is in the old binary format (WPS Office format), not a .docx zip. python-docx can't read it. Let me try to install a WPS reader or use a different approach. But it might be easier to just read the PDF to understand the writing features, since the PDF has the full text with detection annotations.\n\nI have the PDF with the full text - that's sufficient to analyze what the human editors did. Let me extract ALL the text from the PDF and do a comprehensive comparison.\n\nThe PDF has the FULL content of the paper. Let me extract it completely and analyze the writing patterns."}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_M09ttAIXop9vg7j1ctvh0653","name":"run_command","content":"$ python -c \"\nimport pdfplumber, re\npath = r'C:\\Users\\27063\\Desktop\\工具箱\\论文降低aigc分析文献库\\免费_PDF打印版_AIGC检测报告_[论文（修改)].pdf'\nwith pdfplumber.open(path) as pdf:\n    full_text = ''\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        t = page.extract_text()\n        if t: full_text += t + '\\n'\n\ncn = len(re.findall(r'[\\u4e00-\\u9fff]', full_text))\nprint(f'总字数(含检测信息): {cn}')\nprint('='*60)\n\n# 提取正文部分（跳过检测头部信息）\nlines = full_text.split('\\n')\nbody_start = 0\nfor i, line in enumerate(lines):\n    if '课程论文' in line:\n        body_start = i\n        break\n\nbody = '\\n'.join(lines[body_start:])\ncn_body = len(re.findall(r'[\\u4e00-\\u9fff]', body))\nprint(f'正文字数: {cn_body}')\n\nprint('='*60)\nprint('=== 写作特征分析 ===')\nprint('='*60)\n\n# 特征1: 第一人称\nwo = body.count('我') + body.count('我们')\nprint(f'1. 第一人称我/我们: {wo}次')\n\n# 特征2: 模糊限定词\nfuzzy = ['差不多','比较','不太','很难','越来越','较为','相对来说','基本上']\nfor f in fuzzy:\n    c = body.count(f)\n    if c > 0: print(f'2. 模糊词\\\"{f}\\\": {c}次')\n\n# 特征3: 学生标记词\nstu = ['也就是说','换句话说','说白了','我觉得','我认为','从我的角度来看']\nfor s in stu:\n    c = body.count(s)\n    if c > 0: print(f'3. 学生标记\\\"{s}\\\": {c}次')\n\n# 特征4: 具体内容标记\nspec = ['模型','数据','回归','实证','检验','案例','公式','变量','假设']\nfor s in spec:\n    c = body.count(s)\n    if c > 0: print(f'4. 具体内容\\\"{s}\\\": {c}次')\n\n# 特征5: AI套话残留\nai_ph = ['综上所述','总而言之','值得注意的是','不可否认','毋庸置疑']\nfor p in ai_ph:\n    c = body.count(p)\n    if c > 0: print(f'5. AI套话\\\"{p}\\\": {c}次')\n\n# 特征6: 破折号\ndash = body.count('——')\nprint(f'6. 破折号: {dash}个')\n\n# 特征7: 句长分布\nimport math\nsents = []\nfor p in body.split('\\n'):\n    for s in re.split(r'[。！？；]', p):\n        c = len(re.findall(r'[\\u4e00-\\u9fff]', s.strip()))\n        if c >= 4: sents.append(c)\nif sents:\n    avg = sum(sents)/len(sents)\n    std = math.sqrt(sum((s-avg)**2 for s in sents)/len(sents))\n    cov = std/avg*100\n    short = sum(1 for s in sents if s<15)/len(sents)*100\n    long = sum(1 for s in sents if s>40)/len(sents)*100\n    print(f'8. 句长: 均值{avg:.1f} CoV:{cov:.1f}% 短句{short:.1f}% 长句{long:.1f}%')\n\"\n[exit 0]\n总字数(含检测信息): 5042\r\n============================================================\r\n正文字数: 4725\r\n============================================================\r\n=== 写作特征分析 ===\r\n============================================================\r\n1. 第一人称我/我们: 12次\r\n2. 模糊词\"差不多\": 1次\r\n2. 模糊词\"比较\": 2次\r\n2. 模糊词\"很难\": 4次\r\n2. 模糊词\"越来越\": 1次\r\n2. 模糊词\"较为\": 1次\r\n4. 具体内容\"模型\": 3次\r\n4. 具体内容\"数据\": 36次\r\n4. 具体内容\"回归\": 4次\r\n4. 具体内容\"实证\": 7次\r\n4. 具体内容\"检验\": 6次\r\n4. 具体内容\"案例\": 3次\r\n4. 具体内容\"变量\": 2次\r\n6. 破折号: 1个\r\n8. 句长: 均值21.4 CoV:44.6% 短句29.4% 长句0.0%\r\n"}
{"role":"assistant","content":"对比完成。核心发现：\n\n```\n\n人类改的论文(12.56%通过)             我的论文(100%红)\n─────────────────────────     ─────────────────────────\n12次\"我/我们\"                        0次\n数次\"比较/很难/差不多\"                极少\n36次\"数据\" + 回归公式 + 实证检验      无\n10篇真实参考文献                      无\n具体的案例分析(亚投行DID)             泛泛宏观论述\nCoV 44.6% (人类健康范围)             人工调整值\n破折号1个                            几十上百个\n```\n\n**最根本的差距**不是风格，是那篇论文有**真东西**——真实的数据分析、具体的回归模型、实证检验、参考文献。我的论文全是宏观论述，没有落脚点。检测器认的不是\"风格\"，是\"有没有人在认真写一个具体的问题\"。","reasoning_content":"Now I have the full comparison. Let me write a comprehensive summary of the key features of the human-edited paper that achieved 12.56%.\n\nKey features:\n1. **First person (12 times)** - \"我/我们\" used extensively\n2. **Fuzzy qualifiers** - 差不多(1), 比较(2), 很难(4), 越来越(1)\n3. **Real research content** - 模型(3), 数据(36), 实证(7), 检验(6)\n4. **Zero AI template phrases** - No 综上所述, 值得注意的是 etc.\n5. **1 single dash** (vs my 150+)\n6. **CoV 44.6%** (healthy human range)\n7. **Short sentences 29.4%** (lots of short sentences)\n8. **Zero long sentences >40 chars**\n9. **Specific topic**: AIIB + DID model + cross-border data governance\n10. **Real references**: 10 real academic references\n11. **Real research structure**: Abstract→Theory→Model→Data→Results→Conclusion\n\nThe most important insight: **this paper has a REAL research methodology** - it uses DID (Difference-in-Differences) with actual regression analysis. It's not generic discussion. It's specific analysis with data, models, and empirical results.\n\nThis confirms that the BEST defense against AIGC detection is **specific, factual, research-driven content** - not writing style tricks."}
